<title>USA: Golden Pharmaceuticals moves headquarters.</title>
<headline>Golden Pharmaceuticals moves headquarters.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif. 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golden Pharmaceuticals Inc said it has moved its corporate headquarters to Santa Ana from Golden, Colo.</p>
<p>The change was implemented as a result of the previously announced sale of its iodine-123 business to a Syncor International Corp subsidiary, and the resulting increased emphasis on the activities of its Quality Care Pharmaceuticals Inc division.</p>
<p>Golden is primarily engaged in physician dispensing and distribution of pharmaceutical products as well as the development of related and computerized adjudication systems.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
